{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_163_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "27595ec7b716eb6ce18016c5546eb7da6e8c6121ad6ff92beec3aa3f6759f9bc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、おつかれさま！\n今、話しても大丈夫？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦！\n现在方便聊聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
