{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_163_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "a5c31e6a3339dee674581f21e5eb7e6e3287ce5d51a3996a5488c1f4968d8a7e", "ja": "うん！　りーふちゃんからは、\n1日おきくらいにメッセージが来るよ！", "zh": "嗯！りーふ每隔1天左右就会发消息给我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_163_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bc58b23947192920e7db3c05d1e42323e344dba02808a7036bd80f9f5efa7481", "ja": "そんなに話す事があるのか？", "zh": "有那么多话可聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_163_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "bc8401a17dfb25b69ed86a0ccaa659e72e4fbfbf1ae884b11884d57043d81142", "ja": "いっぱいあるよ！　シャイドルの話以外にも、\nアイドルの話とか、新しい学校の話とか……。", "zh": "有很多想聊的呢！除了小偶像的事，\n还有偶像的事，新学校的事等等……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_163_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "2bb9b7ff1948485bfc3233ba894d0f91949f2178b7552dd2347e812dc83f4985", "ja": "本当は通話もできるんだけど、外国だと\n生活リズムが合わないから、むずかしくて。", "zh": "其实也可以打电话，不过在国外的话，生活作息对不上，所以不太方便。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_163_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "c0870c8b60a5b476919e5324ec50280ec6b0c162412cb487daf1f8b0df2b6682", "ja": "だからおたがい、メッセージの返事も、\nいつでもいいってことにしてるんだよ。", "zh": "所以我们约好了，消息回复什么时候都可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_163_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7aa468a3cc6f7e71814a03d176adb496c743cdceb39775df07db3fe0f345c2eb", "ja": "大人の対応だな……。", "zh": "挺成熟的做法啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
