{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_163_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "2a1a05006d5d1e0b64294de36ea4975fbe422e74c1538f10de4a8b2c2d6cd4ff", "ja": "それで、いつかりーふちゃんの住んでる町で、\n公演ができたらいいなぁ……♪", "zh": "这样的话，总有一天，要是能在小里夫住的城市举办演出就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
